#: admin/views/banner.php:859
#, fuzzy, php-format
msgid "No country signal is available on this install. Multi-banner geo-routing will resolve every visitor to \"unknown\" and fall back to your match-all / default banner. The usual fix is to configure %1$s with a free MaxMind GeoLite2 license key. If your site sits behind Cloudflare instead, the %2$s filter is available — note this is a developer code filter, NOT a setting in this screen: a developer adds %3$s in your theme or a code-snippets plugin. Without one of these, the targets you set below have no effect."
msgstr "Na ovoj instalaciji nije dostupan signal za zemlju. Multi-banner geo-usmjeravanje će svakog posjetitelja razriješiti kao „nepoznato“ i koristiti catch-all / zadani banner. Konfigurirajte %1$s s MaxMind GeoLite2 ključem ili omogućite %2$s ako je vaša stranica iza Cloudflareja. Bez jednog od ovih, ciljevi koje postavite u nastavku nemaju učinka."

#: admin/views/banner.php:860
msgid "Settings &raquo; Geolocation"
msgstr "Postavke &raquo; Geolokacija"

#: admin/views/banner.php:882
msgid "How multi-banner works — quick guide"
msgstr "Kako funkcionira više bannera — kratki vodič"

#. translators: %1$s: Geo Targeting (tab name), %2$s: Content (tab name).
#: admin/views/banner.php:889
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s (this tab) = <em>WHICH visitors</em> see this banner. Pick countries / regions; the multi-banner picker matches against the visitor's detected country. Leave empty to make this banner the universal fallback."
msgstr "%1$s (ova kartica) = <em>KOJI posjetitelji</em> vide ovaj banner. Odaberite zemlje/regije; birač više bannera uspoređuje otkrivenu zemlju posjetitelja. Ostavite prazno da ovaj banner bude univerzalni rezervni."

#. translators: %1$s: Content (tab name).
#: admin/views/banner.php:900
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s = <em>WHAT the banner says</em> — title, description, button labels, per-language translations. This is where you put law-specific copy: \"Não vender minhas informações pessoais\" for LGPD (Brazil), \"Do not sell or share my personal information\" for CCPA/CPRA (California 2024+), German consent text for GDPR-DE, and so on. Same banner row, multiple languages."
msgstr "%1$s = <em>ŠTO BANNER GOVORI</em> — naslov, opis, oznake gumba, prijevodi po jeziku. Ovdje unosite tekst specifičan za zakon: \"Não vender minhas informações pessoais\" za LGPD (Brazil), \"Do not sell or share my personal information\" za CCPA/CPRA (Kalifornija 2024+), njemački tekst suglasnosti za GDPR-DE i tako dalje. Isti redak bannera, više jezika."

#: admin/views/banner.php:908
msgid "<strong>EU</strong> preset = 27 EU + 3 EEA (Iceland, Liechtenstein, Norway). It does <em>not</em> include the UK — pick the <strong>United Kingdom</strong> preset separately when you want a UK-GDPR variant with different copy. To cover EU+UK with one banner, tick both presets."
msgstr "<strong>EU unaprijed postavljeno</strong> = 27 EU + 3 EGP (Island, Lihtenštajn, Norveška). <em>Ne</em> uključuje Ujedinjenu Kraljevinu — odaberite zasebno unaprijed postavljeno <strong>United Kingdom</strong> ako želite varijantu UK-GDPR s drugačijim tekstom. Za pokrivenost EU+UK jednim bannerom, označite oba unaprijed postavljena."

