#: admin/views/settings.php:34
msgid "Hide banner from search engine bots"
msgstr "Sakrij banner od robota tražilica"

#: admin/views/settings.php:36
msgid "Automatically detects search engine crawlers (Googlebot, Bingbot, etc.) and skips the banner for them. Improves SEO by serving cleaner HTML to crawlers. Note: with Cache Compatibility Mode enabled the bot-skip is bypassed — cached pages must stay identical for every visitor, so bots receive the banner too."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:42
msgid "Push consent events to GTM Data Layer"
msgstr "Šalji događaje privole u GTM Data Layer"

#: admin/views/settings.php:44
msgid "Pushes a faz_consent_update event with per-category granted/denied values to window.dataLayer after each consent action. Enable if you use Google Tag Manager."
msgstr "Šalje događaj faz_consent_update s vrijednostima granted/denied po kategoriji u window.dataLayer nakon svake radnje privole. Omogućite ako koristite Google Tag Manager."

#: admin/views/settings.php:50
msgid "Ad-blocker compatibility mode"
msgstr "Način kompatibilnosti s blokatorima oglasa"

#: admin/views/settings.php:52
msgid "Uses generic script handle names to prevent ad blockers from blocking the cookie banner. Enable if visitors report the banner not appearing."
msgstr "Koristi generičke nazive handleova skripti kako bi spriječio blokatore oglasa da blokiraju banner za kolačiće. Omogućite ako posjetitelji prijavljuju da se banner ne prikazuje."

#: admin/views/settings.php:58
msgid "Keep banner visible against ad blockers"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:60
msgid "If an ad blocker's cosmetic filter list hides the consent banner (some lists hide any element whose name contains \"cookie\" or \"consent\"), this re-asserts the banner's visibility once, shortly after it loads, so the legally required notice is not suppressed. It never forces interaction and respects a visitor who has already accepted, rejected or dismissed. This is different from Ad-blocker compatibility mode above, which stops the banner script itself from being blocked."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:66
msgid "Enable per-service consent"
msgstr "Omogući privolu po usluzi"

#: admin/views/settings.php:68
msgid "When enabled, visitors can accept or reject individual services (e.g., Google Analytics, YouTube) instead of entire categories. Services detected by the scanner are shown immediately, and embedded providers blocked at runtime are revealed when the browser sees them on the page. This keeps the preference center present-aware but makes it more complex."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, posjetitelji mogu prihvatiti ili odbiti pojedinačne usluge (npr. Google Analytics, YouTube) umjesto cijelih kategorija. Usluge koje otkrije skener prikazuju se odmah, a ugrađeni pružatelji blokirani u runtimeu otkrivaju se kada ih preglednik vidi na stranici. Time centar postavki ostaje svjestan stvarne prisutnosti usluga, ali postaje složeniji."

#: admin/views/settings.php:96
msgid "Enable per-cookie consent"
msgstr "Omogući privolu po kolačiću"

#: admin/views/settings.php:98
msgid "Requires per-service consent. Adds a nested row for each cookie a service declares. First-party cookies that the site can write are enforced by client cleanup and the server-side shredder. Cookies set by embedded third-party services on their own domains (for example YouTube, Vimeo, Maps, social embeds) cannot be deleted individually by this site; those rows are shown as disabled and are controlled by allowing or blocking the whole embed."
msgstr "Zahtijeva privolu po usluzi. Dodaje ugniježđeni redak za svaki kolačić koji usluga deklarira. First-party kolačići koje web-mjesto može zapisati provode se klijentskim čišćenjem i poslužiteljskim shredderom. Kolačiće koje ugrađene usluge trećih strana postavljaju na vlastitim domenama (na primjer YouTube, Vimeo, Maps, društveni embedovi) ovo web-mjesto ne može pojedinačno izbrisati; ti se redci prikazuju kao onemogućeni i kontroliraju se dopuštanjem ili blokiranjem cijelog embeda."

#: admin/views/settings.php:104
msgid "Share consent across subdomains"
msgstr "Dijeli privolu među poddomenama"

#: admin/views/settings.php:106
msgid "Scope the consent cookie to your registrable domain (e.g. .example.com) so it is shared across www, shop, app, etc. Recommended only when all subdomains belong to you and are covered by the same privacy policy. Public-suffix-aware for multi-level TLDs (.co.uk, .com.au)."
msgstr "Ogranite kolačić privole na svoju registrabilnu domenu (npr. .example.com) kako bi se dijelio na www, shop, app itd. Preporučuje se samo kada svi poddomeni pripadaju vama i pokriveni su istom politikom privatnosti. Podržava javne sufikse za višerazinske TLD-ove (.co.uk, .com.au)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:112
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cache compatibility mode"
msgstr "Način kompatibilnosti s blokatorima oglasa"

#: admin/views/settings.php:114
msgid "Keep the page fully cacheable by LiteSpeed, QUIC.cloud, Varnish, Nginx FastCGI or WP Rocket. The plugin stops emitting <code>no-cache</code>/<code>no-store</code> headers and the <code>DONOTCACHEPAGE</code> constant for anonymous visitors, so the static HTML is cached and the banner runs entirely client-side from the consent cookie. <strong>Only enable this if your banner output does NOT vary by visitor country.</strong> With IAB TCF, geo-targeting, country-targeted banners or runtime geo-routing active, the same cached HTML would be served to every region (e.g. an EU TCF <code>gdprApplies=true</code> page reaching a US visitor) — keep this OFF in that case, or vary the cache by country at the CDN. This mode also bypasses the bot-skip (\"Hide banner from search engine bots\") and pauses server-side A/B banner splitting."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:120
msgid "A/B test banner variants"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:122
msgid "Run two or more of your existing banners at the same time. A visitor is randomly shown one eligible variant without creating an experiment cookie before consent; after a choice, the banner slug in the consent record keeps the assignment stable. Acceptance rate per variant is reported on the Dashboard. Variants must use the same privacy-law and Do-Not-Sell model; country targeting is always respected, so the experiment can vary presentation but never a visitor's legal regime. <strong>Requires Cache Compatibility Mode above to be OFF</strong>, because a per-visitor split cannot run behind full-page caching."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:125
msgid "Variants in the test group"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:126
msgid "Select two or more active banners with the same consent model. Incompatible or country-ineligible banners are ignored for that visitor."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings.php:128
#, fuzzy
msgid "Loading banners…"
msgstr "Učitavanje…"

#: admin/views/settings.php:136 admin/views/system-status.php:101
msgid "Cross-Domain Consent"
msgstr "Privola između domena"

#: admin/views/settings.php:143
msgid "Enable cross-domain consent forwarding"
msgstr "Omogući prosljeđivanje privole između domena"

#: admin/views/settings.php:145
msgid "Share consent choices across multiple domains. When a visitor accepts or rejects cookies on one domain, the same choice is forwarded to all configured target domains via secure postMessage."
msgstr "Dijelite odabire privole između više domena. Kada posjetitelj prihvati ili odbije kolačiće na jednoj domeni, isti odabir prosljeđuje se svim konfiguriranim ciljnim domenama putem sigurnog postMessage mehanizma."

#: admin/views/settings.php:148
msgid "Target Domains"
msgstr "Ciljne domene"

#: admin/views/settings.php:149
msgid "One per line: https://shop.example.com"
msgstr "Jedna po retku: https://shop.example.com"

#: admin/views/settings.php:150
msgid "Full URLs of other sites that should receive consent state. Each site must also have FAZ Cookie Manager installed. One URL per line."
msgstr "Puni URL-ovi drugih stranica koje trebaju primiti stanje privole. Svaka stranica također mora imati instaliran FAZ Cookie Manager. Jedan URL po retku."

#: admin/views/settings.php:157 admin/views/system-status.php:82
msgid "Pageview Tracking"
msgstr "Praćenje pregleda stranica"

#: admin/views/settings.php:164
msgid "Enable pageview and banner interaction tracking"
msgstr "Omogući praćenje pregleda stranica i interakcija s bannerom"

#: admin/views/settings.php:166
msgid "Tracks pageviews and banner interactions (accept, reject, settings) for the dashboard analytics. Data is aggregate-only: it sends the page URL and title with no per-visitor identifier or cookie, so the events cannot be linked across pages or sessions. Counts are stored first-party in your own database. Disable for stricter compliance."
msgstr "Prati preglede stranica i interakcije s bannerom (prihvaćanje, odbijanje, postavke) za analitiku nadzorne ploče. Podaci su isključivo skupni: šalju se samo URL i naslov stranice, bez identifikatora pojedinog posjetitelja ili kolačića, pa se događaji ne mogu povezivati među stranicama ili sesijama. Brojevi se pohranjuju kao podaci prve strane u vašoj vlastitoj bazi podataka. Onemogućite za strožu usklađenost."

#: admin/views/settings.php:169
