#~ msgid "Detect VPN/proxy/Tor visitors via <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ipinfo.io</a>. When a VPN is detected, the plugin falls back to the most-protective rule-set (gdpr-strict) regardless of the visitor's apparent country. Opt-in is gated by your acknowledgment of the cross-border data-transfer obligations under GDPR / DPF / SCC."
#~ msgstr "Otkrijte posjetitelje koji koriste VPN/proxy/Tor putem <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ipinfo.io</a>. Kada se otkrije VPN, dodatak primjenjuje najrestriktivniji skup pravila (gdpr-strict) bez obzira na prividnu zemlju posjetitelja. Opt-in je uvjetovan vašim prihvaćanjem obveza prekograničnog prijenosa podataka prema GDPR-u / DPF-u / SCC-u."

#~ msgid "How long consent records are kept before automatic deletion. Most DPAs recommend 12 months. Logs older than this period are purged daily."
#~ msgstr "Koliko dugo se zapisi privola čuvaju prije automatskog brisanja. Većina nadzornih tijela preporučuje 12 mjeseci. Zapisi stariji od tog razdoblja brišu se svakodnevno."

#~ msgid "Scripts that should never be blocked, even before consent. One per line. Accepts three types of pattern:<br>- <strong>URL fragment</strong> (contains <code>.</code> or <code>/</code>): matched against the script's <code>src</code> or related URL attribute, e.g. <code>googleapis.com/youtube/v3</code>.<br>- <strong>Script ID</strong> (no dots/slashes): matched against the <code>id</code> attribute of the script tag, e.g. <code>my-product-form-data</code>.<br>- <strong>CSS class</strong> (no dots/slashes): matched against the script's <code>class</code> attribute, e.g. <code>recaptcha</code>.<br>These exceptions bypass blocking entirely. Use them only for scripts that genuinely do not set tracking cookies. <strong>Be specific</strong> to avoid accidentally unblocking trackers.<br><strong>Tip:</strong> You can also add <code>class=\"faz-skip\"</code> directly to any script tag to exclude it without adding anything here — no configuration needed."
#~ msgstr "Skripte koje nikada ne smiju biti blokirane, čak ni prije privole. Jedna po retku. Prihvaća tri vrste uzoraka:<br>- <strong>Fragment URL-a</strong> (sadrži <code>.</code> ili <code>/</code>): usporeduje se s atributom <code>src</code> skripte ili srodnim URL-om, npr. <code>googleapis.com/youtube/v3</code>.<br>- <strong>ID skripte</strong> (bez točaka/kosačica): usporeduje se s atributom <code>id</code> oznake skripte, npr. <code>my-product-form-data</code>.<br>- <strong>CSS klasa</strong> (bez točaka/kosačica): usporeduje se s atributom <code>class</code> skripte, npr. <code>recaptcha</code>.<br>Ove iznimke u potpunosti zaobilaze blokiranje. Koristite ih samo za skripte koje zaista ne postavljaju kolačiće za praćenje. <strong>Budite precizni</strong> kako biste izbjegli slučajno deblokiranje pračitelja.<br><strong>Savjet:</strong> možete i dodati <code>class=\"faz-skip\"</code> izravno bilo kojoj oznaci skripte kako biste je isključili bez dodavanja ičega ovdje — nije potrebna nikakva konfiguracija."

